    <informations>Shelly 2L Gen3 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O2 S2 L O1 S1 Sx.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-2l-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_fc5b90dc9caf2c688c768015926f55ec698b2c5cdb2a3f677a7306442a6f3b20/Shelly%202L%20Gen3.png?cb=9534eb3c8852f0d5ea4eb64562960250
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_701387eea946fd54d0ddb33b2096126460dd5a432c6dfa0d80a8ebf7f0663e21/2L-Gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=c8835d113a6d931c838644db8a01289d
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_b201399599b59020dc716f5b30cfd6eec6c2e3812cc6587e0dc564c8161ed77e/Shelly%202L%20Gen3%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=924716351e1102d33ea7129c9c0d31b5

Notes:
- No neutral screw.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
